      "reviewerRecommendation": "Retain the Canadian C-Spine Rule using NICE NG41. For adults, use CT when imaging is indicated by the rule. Remove NEXUS from V1 unless separately sourced. Keep vascular/neurological red flags separate from the trauma-imaging rule; do not use 5Ds/3Ns as a clearance rule.",
