      "independentEvidenceRecommendation": "supported",
      "independentWordingRecommendation": "accept",
      "reviewerRecommendation": "NICE NG226 directly supports not routinely offering paracetamol/weak opioids except infrequent short-term use when other options are unsuitable, and not offering strong opioids for OA. Keep the existing caveat that this is general OA guidance, not elbow-specific evidence.",
